{
  "notes": [
    "Independent expected vectors derived from manufacturer manual only. Sparse maps intentionally leave unconstrained state unspecified.",
    "Digits in register/storage maps are integer nibbles; map keys are hexadecimal register identifiers.",
    "These are behavior specifications, not a harness coupled to an implementation.",
    "Native timing, input sampling edge polarity, random-counter algorithm, held-key behavior, malformed-opcode handling and invalid decimal DZHX output are not specified by consulted pages."
